# Student Registration System

A simple Student Registration System developed using the LEMP Stack and deployed on an AWS EC2 Ubuntu server.

## 📌 Project Overview

The Student Registration System is a web-based application designed to collect and store student registration information.

The project is developed using HTML, CSS and PHP, with MariaDB used as the database. The application is deployed on an Ubuntu EC2 instance using Nginx.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

- To create a simple student registration form.
- To collect student information through a web interface.
- To store student information in a database.
- To deploy the application on AWS EC2.
- To use Nginx as the web server.
- To use PHP for backend processing.
- To use MariaDB for database management.
- To maintain the project using Git and GitHub.

---

